  },
  {
    title: 'Procurement or vendor management, if the negotiation and sourcing side interests you more than movement and warehousing',
    body: 'A closely related but distinct specialisation focused on sourcing and vendor relationships rather than physical movement and storage — worth a look if contract negotiation and supplier strategy is the real draw.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Data analytics or business intelligence, if the analytical side interests you more than operational execution',
    body: 'A genuinely different, broader specialisation without the physical-operations component — worth comparing if the real interest is data and forecasting work rather than logistics specifically.',
