  <p>
    A single "logistics salary in India" figure hides more than it reveals, because an analytical supply chain
    planner with a few years of experience can out-earn an operations executive who has stayed purely execution
    focused for far longer.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
