  <h2 id="checkpoint">Use The 4-Checkpoint Protocol before you commit to this path</h2>

  <p>
    A single salary figure, or one relative's opinion about "logistics being a booming field," cannot tell you
    whether this path genuinely fits your specific situation. The 4-Checkpoint Protocol narrows the decision to
    what actually matters for you.
  </p>

  <div class="protocol-stack">
    {checkpointItems.map((item) => (
      <div class="checkpoint">
        <div class="checkpoint__num">{item.num}</div>
        <div class="checkpoint__body">
          <div class="checkpoint__title">{item.title}</div>
          <p>{item.body}</p>
          <div class="checkpoint__note">{item.note}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="gates">Pass The 3 Gates before you commit real years to this path</h2>

  <p>
    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether logistics fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it in the real
